# C8 item 1, ANION model: FINE relaxed scan around the shallow barrier maximum.
#
# The coarse scan (scan_anion/, 1.40-2.80 in 0.1 steps) put the maximum at
# 1.80 A, +17 kJ/mol off the bonded end. An OptTS from there did not converge --
# 400 cycles, Hessian mostly 0 negative eigenvalues -- because the barrier is
# only ~17 kJ/mol and the surface between ~1.6 and 2.5 A is nearly flat, so
# eigenvector-following cannot pin a soft saddle on it.
#
# This refines the maximum on the grid, 1.70-1.95 in 0.025 A steps, before
# another attempt at the saddle. Seed = scan_anion/job.005.xyz (the 1.80 point).
#
# NO Calc_Hess: with Calc_Hess true a scan writes step 1's Hessian as
# job.001.hess but then reads job.hess at step 2 and dies (2026-09-25).
# Charge convention: QM region charge on the *xyzfile line; Charge_total = whole
# system. QM -1, host 0, total -1.
! QM/XTB B97-3c ddCOSMO(Water) Opt TightOpt TightSCF

%QMMM
QMATOMS
	{55 58 61 64 120 121 122 123 124 125 126 127 128 129 130 131 132}
END
Charge_total -1
Mult_total 1
AutoFF_QM2_Method GFNFF
END

%geom
  Scan
    B 128 130 = 1.70, 1.95, 11
  end
  MaxIter 200
end

%output jsonpropfile true end

%maxcore 4000

%pal
   nprocs 8
end

* xyzfile -1 1 job.xyz
